                      (adybug/src/main.s):00277                 org     $C000
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00278         
C000 444B             (adybug/src/main.s):00279                 fcc     "DK"            ; ROM-pack autostart magic; FIRQ -> $C002
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00280         
