                      (adybug/src/main.s):01441         ; Store the original nontransparent destination operations as bounded sparse
                      (adybug/src/main.s):01442         ; runs.  The record begins with a run count.  Each run is
                      (adybug/src/main.s):01443         ; {delta-from-prior-cursor, length, preserve-mask, opaque-value...}; delta is
                      (adybug/src/main.s):01444         ; one byte except $FF followed by a 16-bit delta.  A normal object produces
                      (adybug/src/main.s):01445         ; 29..37 pairs in 10..12 row-bounded runs, so the 128-byte/entity allocation
                      (adybug/src/main.s):01446         ; remains hard bounded while preserving both writes generated from every source
                      (adybug/src/main.s):01447         ; byte.  The cache is refreshed with every normal draw/recolour.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):01448         ; Inputs: U selected LUT; ENTITY_PTR and draw scratch. Returns: registers undefined.
