CA47 B7FF21           (adybug/src/main.s):01850                 sta     PIA2_CRA
CA4A 7FFF23           (adybug/src/main.s):01851                 clr     PIA2_CRB
CA4D 8634             (adybug/src/main.s):01852                 lda     #$34            ; static CB2 low enables analog multiplexer
